auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  Conforma API.
  
  AUTH: both tokens are HttpOnly cookies, set by Set-Cookie and never returned in a response body. Bruno stores and resends them per domain automatically, so run Public > Login once and every other request is authenticated -- there is no token to copy anywhere.
  
  The access token is short-lived and renewed silently by the server whenever it lapses, so a collection left open keeps working. Run Authorized > Logout to end the session.
  
  Select the Local environment for base_url and the seeded admin credentials.
}
